I actually think you've stumbled onto something more interesting than most "AI philosophy" channels.

The thing I'd caution against is **trying to compete with cinematic AI channels**. You'll lose. There are thousands of channels making "beautiful AI dreamscapes." In a year, everyone will have them.

Your **unfair advantage** is that you're building **a visual language**.

