# Proposed video pipeline

```text
Script
  ↓
Paragraph/beat analysis
  ↓
LLM assigns visual functions
  ↓
Asset retrieval from visual library
  ↓
LLM outputs timeline JSON
  ↓
Python validates and normalises it
  ↓
FFmpeg renders:
    black
    clips
    historical artwork
    quotes
    subtitles
    narration
    ambience
  ↓
Final MP4
```

## Your video language

Every item on the timeline should be one of a few controlled event types:

```text
black
visual
artwork
quote
chapter_title
transition
```

That is enough for the initial system.

