# Black should be structurally encoded

Make black a real event—not simply an absence of media.

```json
{
  "type": "black",
  "duration": 1.8,
  "audio_continues": true
}
```

Then the model can deliberately use it for:

* breathing room;
* section changes;
* quote preparation;
* transitions between incompatible imagery;
* contemplative pauses.

Set hard rules:

```text
Every visual enters from black or leaves into black.
Do not use decorative transitions.
Default fade duration: 0.8–1.5 seconds.
Use direct cuts only for deliberate intellectual emphasis.
Allow narration to continue through black.
```

That becomes your formal grammar.

