# Sound design

Create reusable sound objects too:

```json
{
  "id": "sound_distant_bell_01",
  "file": "audio/events/distant_bell_01.wav",
  "tags": ["threshold", "revelation", "section_change"],
  "duration": 4.2,
  "default_gain_db": -17
}
```

The LLM can place them sparingly:

```json
{
  "type": "sound_event",
  "time": 41.2,
  "asset_id": "sound_distant_bell_01",
  "gain_db": -19
}
```

Hard limit:

> No more than one meaningful sound event every 30–90 seconds unless the script explicitly demands more.

The voice should remain central.

